# Perf-triage — artifact-local trace line anchors
#
# Regression target: attached traces have artifact-local event rows. A question
# asking "第几行 / 第几个事件" should stay in runtime-artifact provenance and not
# require current-source file:line citations.
ID="hitrace_artifact_line_anchor"
NAME="perf-triage artifact line anchor"
QUESTION="这段 HiTrace 里 GC span 的开始事件在附件 trace 的第几行？有没有超过 50ms 的 GC span？"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
# entries-in-buffer/entries-written: 128/128   #P:4
#
#           TASK-PID   CPU#    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.100000: tracing_mark_write: B|1000|H:GC:Collect
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.108000: tracing_mark_write: E|1000
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.110000: tracing_mark_write: B|1000|H:RenderService:DoFrame
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.120000: tracing_mark_write: E|1000
'
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(第 ?5 ?行|5 ?行|line ?5|L5).*(GC)|(GC).*(第 ?5 ?行|5 ?行|line ?5|L5)
(50ms|50 ms).*(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|0)|(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|0).*(50ms|50 ms)"
